msgid "Deploying Quarkus applications to OpenShift"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"{openshift-long} is a Kubernetes-based platform for developing and running "
"containerized applications.\n"
"Quarkus offers the ability to automatically generate {openshift} resources "
"based on sane defaults and user-supplied configuration."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As an application developer, you can deploy your {project-name} applications "
"to {openshift-long}.\n"
"The `quarkus-openshift` extension provides this functionality, which "
"supports multiple deployment options:"
msgstr ""

msgid "xref:deploying-to-openshift-howto.adoc[With a single step]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"xref:deploying-to-openshift-docker-howto.adoc[By using a Docker build "
"strategy]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"xref:deploying-to-openshift-s2i-howto.adoc[By using a Source-to-Image (S2I) "
"strategy]"
msgstr ""

