msgid "Overview of OpenShift build strategies"
msgstr ""

msgid "Docker build"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This strategy builds the artifacts outside the {openshift} cluster, locally "
"or in a CI environment, and provides them to the {openshift} build system "
"together with a Dockerfile.\n"
"The artifacts include JAR files or a native executable.\n"
"The container gets built inside the {openshift} cluster and is provided as "
"an image stream."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The {openshift} Docker build strategy is the preferred build strategy "
"because it supports Quarkus applications targeted for JVM or compiled to "
"native executables.\n"
"However, for compatibility with earlier Quarkus versions, the default build "
"strategy is S2I.\n"
"To select the {openshift} Docker build strategy, use the `quarkus.openshift."
"build-strategy` property."
msgstr ""

msgid "Source to Image (S2I)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The build process is performed inside the {openshift} cluster.\n"
"{project-name} fully supports using S2I to deploy {project-name} as a JVM "
"application."
msgstr ""

msgid "Binary S2I"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This strategy uses a JAR file as input to the S2I build process, which "
"speeds up the building and deploying of your application."
msgstr ""

